&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion at SoundCloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;SoundCloud is for everyone.&amp;nbsp;Diversity and open expression are fundamental to our organization; they help us lead what’s next in music by&amp;nbsp;understanding and empowering our creators and fans, no matter their identity. We acknowledge the challenges in the music industry, and strive to&amp;nbsp;influence an inclusive culture where everyone can contribute respectfully and thrive, especially the historically marginalized communities that many of our creators, fans and SoundClouders identify with. We are dedicated to creating an inclusive environment at SoundCloud for everyone, regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, migration background, national origin, age, disability status, or care-giver status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At SoundCloud you can find your community or elevate your allyship by joining a Diversity Resource Group. Diversity Resource Groups are employee-organized groups focused on supporting and promoting the interests of a particular underrepresented community in order to build a more inclusive culture at SoundCloud. Anyone can join, whether you share the identity or strive to be an ally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;SoundCloud empowers artists and fans to connect and share through music. Founded in 2007, SoundCloud is an artist-first platform empowering artists to build and grow their careers by providing them with the most progressive tools, services, and resources. With over 400+ million tracks from 40 million artists, the future of music is SoundCloud.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SoundCloud is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Backend Engineer to join our Anti-Abuse Team&lt;/strong&gt;, with a mission to keep connections between fans and creators safe and authentic, while building and operating an abuse prevention platform at global scale. The role can be based in either our &lt;strong&gt;Berlin or London&lt;/strong&gt; office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services are at the heart of SoundCloud’s user journeys. We operate a substantial suite of event-based services, combining specialised and generalised detection approaches to tackle complex architectural problems where scale, adaptability and fast decision-making are critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a self-sufficient team passionate about abuse prevention, building scalable and adaptable solutions that stay ahead of emerging risks. The role combines long-term platform and architecture work with rapid response to new abuse vectors, giving you the opportunity to solve both strategic and time-sensitive engineering problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have significant end-to-end ownership to identify problems, shape solutions and drive projects from the ground up, working directly with engineering and T&amp;amp;S Professionals. If you’re creative, proactive and enjoy being the expert who turns complex problems into effective solutions, you’ll have plenty of room to make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve reusable platform capabilities and services that enable other teams to detect and respond to emerging abuse patterns at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the platform architecture and technical strategy, balancing long-term scalability with rapid responses to emerging challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Analytics, Trust &amp;amp; Safety professionals, and Engineering teams to identify and address abuse patterns across the organisation, driving alignment on solutions and communicating complex technical concepts clearly to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own problems end-to-end, from identifying opportunities and defining solutions to driving projects through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make pragmatic technical decisions, balancing cost, latency, complexity, scalability and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architecture discussions, contribute to technical strategy, and improve engineering practices, processes and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex issues across data pipelines and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously learn and share knowledge of industry best practices in abuse prevention and detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of on-call rotation to ensure the reliability and availability of SoundCloud’s systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing APIs and backend services consumed by multiple client platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills for massive datasets (e.g. BigQuery or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of different API communication patterns (e.g., gRPC, GraphQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience with Go; experience with Scala or another language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience in abuse prevention, fraud detection or Trust &amp;amp; Safety is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience using AI-assisted development tools and a strong intuition for their strengths, weaknesses, and emerging opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional software engineering experience, including significant experience designing and operating distributed, event-driven backend systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with infrastructure as code (IaC) using Terraform and cloud-native environments such as AWS or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building distributed data processing and ETL pipelines, metrics and supporting ML infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices, SQL and NoSQL databases, container technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about the craft of software engineering: continuous delivery, defensive programming, automated testing, security, clean code principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of ownership and are comfortable navigating ambiguity in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a humble, collaborative, team-first mindset and an eagerness to learn and support your colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus point: You love music&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a multinational company with offices in the US (New York and Los Angeles), Germany (Berlin), and the UK (London)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide a flexible work culture that offers the opportunity to collaborate and connect in person at our offices as well as accommodating work from home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are deeply committed to ensuring diversity, equity and inclusion at all levels of our organization and fostering a community where everyone’s voice, perspective and experience is respected and heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe a strong team is made by investing in employees through mentorship, workshops and enrichment opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: The Recruiter will supply the benefit points based on the location&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion at SoundCloud&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SoundCloud is for everyone. Diversity and open expression are fundamental to our organization; they help us lead what’s next in music by understanding and empowering our creators and fans, no matter their identity. We acknowledge the challenges in the music industry, and strive to influence an inclusive culture where everyone can contribute respectfully and thrive, especially the historically marginalized communities that many of our creators, fans and SoundClouders identify with. We are dedicated to creating an inclusive environment at SoundCloud for everyone, regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, migration background, national origin, age, disability status, or care-giver status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;At SoundCloud you can find your community or elevate your allyship by joining a Diversity Resource Group. Diversity Resource Groups are employee-organized groups focused on supporting and promoting the interests of a particular underrepresented community in order to build a more inclusive culture at SoundCloud. Anyone can join, whether you share the identity or strive to be an ally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SoundCloud empowers artists, tastemakers and fans to connect and share through music. Founded in 2007, SoundCloud is a creator-first platform helping artists build and grow their careers by providing them with the most advanced tools, services, and resources.&amp;nbsp;With over 4x the music catalog of every other major streaming platform, spanning 40+ million artists across 190+ countries, SoundCloud is where emerging artists find their sound, hidden gems are discovered, and music culture is shaped in real time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;SoundCloud is looking for a Staff Accountant with a passion for numbers to join our great finance team in New York! In this role, you will be part of a dynamic Finance team distributed across our offices in the US and Berlin. The position will focus on supporting our music distribution, premium artist, and advertising business lines. You will work closely with stakeholders across multiple lines of business and global teams, contributing your skills to core finance-related processes and projects within the SoundCloud Group. As part of our US finance function, you will collaborate closely with team members in Berlin while taking ownership of your day-to-day responsibilities. Experienced colleagues are dedicated to sharing their knowledge to help you thrive, grow your skill set, and expand your impact. Following an initial onboarding phase, you will have the opportunity to help streamline and elevate our accounting processes as our business continues to evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage monthly &amp;amp; annual closing and reporting for the distribution line of business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own Revenue Recognition and Accounts Receivable, including the reconciliation process between DSP reporting, our royalties system, and the general ledger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execute monthly reconciliations of all accounts associated with your respective business lines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Track Cash and Marketing advance payments and recoupments, including ensuring that all recoupable expenses are accurately associated with an artist account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain General Ledger bookkeeping, ensuring accuracy and completeness for all P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet items within your respective business line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Creating and processing outgoing invoices to customers and booking the receipt of associated cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Processing record label and music publishing invoices and payments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partnering with our FP&amp;amp;A department&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaboration with other teams on accounting matters/projects, acting as a proactive business partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;1+ year of experience in Accounting or Auditing, preferably in the Music industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong skills in MS Excel and good knowledge in the use of ERP systems (Oracle Fusion would be a plus)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of US GAAP and/or IFRS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced and ambitious work environment in which colleagues are measured by outputs and not formalities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical skills and a structured approach to work are as much a part of your personality as your ability to work in a team and your strong sense of initiative&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is $70,000 - $75,000 annually. The final salary offered will be determined based on relative experience, skills, internal equity, and location. We also offer a generous total rewards program - read more about additional benefits and perks below! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are a multinational company with offices in the US (New York and Los Angeles), Germany (Berlin), and the UK (London)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We provide a flexible work culture that offers the opportunity to collaborate and connect in person at our offices as well as accommodating work from home&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are deeply committed to ensuring diversity, equity and inclusion at all levels of our organization and fostering a community where everyone’s voice, perspective and experience is respected and heard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe a strong team is made by investing in employees through mentorship, workshops and enrichment opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health benefits, including medical, dental, and vision plans, as well as mental health resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Robust 401k program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Employee &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity&lt;/span&gt; Plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous professional development allowance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Interested in a gym membership, photography course, or book? We have a Creativity and Wellness benefit!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation and public holiday policy, where you can take up to 35 days of PTO annually&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;16 paid weeks for all parents (birthing and non-birthing), regardless of gender, to welcome newborns, adopted, and foster children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Various snacks, goodies, and 2 free lunches weekly when at the office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion at SoundCloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;SoundCloud is for everyone. Diversity and open expression are fundamental to our organization; they help us lead what’s next in music by understanding and empowering our creators and fans, no matter their identity. We acknowledge the challenges in the music industry, and strive to influence an inclusive culture where everyone can contribute respectfully and thrive, especially the historically marginalized communities that many of our creators, fans, and SoundClouders identify with. We are dedicated to creating an inclusive environment at SoundCloud for everyone, regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, migration background, national origin, age, disability status, or care-giver status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SoundCloud, you can find your community or elevate your allyship by joining a Diversity Resource Group. Diversity Resource Groups are employee-organized groups focused on supporting and promoting the interests of a particular underrepresented community in order to build a more inclusive culture at SoundCloud. Anyone can join, whether you share the identity or strive to be an ally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
